27a4bcbf [glm-5.3] #
27a4bcbf [glm-5.3] #Also worth noting: `ws.onclose` firing after `onerror` — fine. Reconnect timer not cleared — if the module is reloaded (HMR with Vite etc.), you might get multiple clients. In a Vite dev environment, HMR would re-run the module and create another client while the old one still reconnects. That's a real practical gotcha with `ws://localhost:8080` + top-level side effects. Worth mentioning.
